sequenceDiagram
    actor Client as Cliente
    participant REST as Adaptador REST
    participant UC as Caso de uso
    participant PORT as Puerto salida
    participant AD as Adaptador elegido
    participant DB as Motor
    Client->>REST: Petición + motor
    REST->>UC: Solicitud dominio
    UC->>PORT: Operación
    PORT->>AD: Resolver MARIA/MONGO
    AD->>DB: Leer / persistir
    DB-->>AD: Resultado
    AD-->>UC: Dominio
    UC-->>REST: Resultado
    REST-->>Client: HTTP
